    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/a9799b37ac87aa592a8ffc98690aaa50.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/5ca772df5c4d151582e7cdd95498f116.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/5ca772df5c4d151582e7cdd95498f116.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/5ca772df5c4d151582e7cdd95498f116.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of tactical mayhem, with <strong>dozens of unique weapons</strong> to obliterate your opponents, on an everchanging battlefield with <strong>destructible terrain.</strong>\u00a0Manage your arsenal and unleash <strong>epic and game-changing combos</strong>, online and offline, solo or with friends, and become the greatest in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galaxy Tactics focuses on enabling <strong>effective strategic planning</strong> for each individual player as well as cooperation between teammates. Effectively utilizing your <strong>expansive arsenal</strong> and managing your <strong>energy and jetpack fuel</strong> are critical in your success on the destructible battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/f6b1c37f5d6ae3a03c3977db3a7ec18f.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/f6b1c37f5d6ae3a03c3977db3a7ec18f.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/f6b1c37f5d6ae3a03c3977db3a7ec18f.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wide variety of <strong>offensive weapons</strong>, <strong>defensive tools</strong> and <strong>utility items</strong> is the heart of Galaxy Tactics. With dozens to unlock, upgrade and strategically put to use, matches are sure to always be fun and exciting. And coupled with the <strong>limitless possible interactions</strong> between weapons, unpredictable outcomes are sure to be expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/402c8f40c4bd18363f9f0510ffa6ff4b.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/402c8f40c4bd18363f9f0510ffa6ff4b.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/402c8f40c4bd18363f9f0510ffa6ff4b.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to battle as one of the galaxy\u2019s elite rangers! With every ranger having a <strong>unique ability</strong>, you get the opportunity to customize and adjust your playstyle and strategy. Gain XP and level up your rangers to <strong>unlock new weapons, stat upgrade points, chromas and more</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/41fdea95c42d4aebd01f40ec2ecdcadf.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/41fdea95c42d4aebd01f40ec2ecdcadf.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/41fdea95c42d4aebd01f40ec2ecdcadf.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From windy deserts to acidic oceans and asteroid rings, you will have to adapt to an <strong>ever-changing battlefield</strong> thanks to the <strong>destructible terrain</strong>, ensuring each and every game is completely unique. Take cover, trap opponents, and use the terrain to your advantage across a multitude of maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/362120d1d3ea429603594b9ae664fa78.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/362120d1d3ea429603594b9ae664fa78.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/362120d1d3ea429603594b9ae664fa78.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re feeling competitive or just want to relax and have fun, Galaxy Tactics has you covered with the various game modes, for a great experience at any skill level, both online and offline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Game</strong> \u2013 No-stakes online either solo or co-op with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked</strong> \u2013 Competitive online with ranks from Silver to Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournaments</strong> \u2013 Monthly online regional competitions with trophy rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaigns\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Singleplayer storylines across the Starhaven galaxy (this feature is in development and not available in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish</strong> \u2013 Offline with bots, with adjustable difficulty and mutators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice</strong> \u2013 Weapons testing and training without limits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/eb626303f08e4f5315b1f09aa027ec6a.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/eb626303f08e4f5315b1f09aa027ec6a.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/eb626303f08e4f5315b1f09aa027ec6a.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/a9799b37ac87aa592a8ffc98690aaa50.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/5ca772df5c4d151582e7cdd95498f116.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/5ca772df5c4d151582e7cdd95498f116.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/5ca772df5c4d151582e7cdd95498f116.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of tactical mayhem, with <strong>dozens of unique weapons</strong> to obliterate your opponents, on an everchanging battlefield with <strong>destructible terrain.</strong>\u00a0Manage your arsenal and unleash <strong>epic and game-changing combos</strong>, online and offline, solo or with friends, and become the greatest in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galaxy Tactics focuses on enabling <strong>effective strategic planning</strong> for each individual player as well as cooperation between teammates. Effectively utilizing your <strong>expansive arsenal</strong> and managing your <strong>energy and jetpack fuel</strong> are critical in your success on the destructible battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/f6b1c37f5d6ae3a03c3977db3a7ec18f.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/f6b1c37f5d6ae3a03c3977db3a7ec18f.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/f6b1c37f5d6ae3a03c3977db3a7ec18f.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wide variety of <strong>offensive weapons</strong>, <strong>defensive tools</strong> and <strong>utility items</strong> is the heart of Galaxy Tactics. With dozens to unlock, upgrade and strategically put to use, matches are sure to always be fun and exciting. And coupled with the <strong>limitless possible interactions</strong> between weapons, unpredictable outcomes are sure to be expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/402c8f40c4bd18363f9f0510ffa6ff4b.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/402c8f40c4bd18363f9f0510ffa6ff4b.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/402c8f40c4bd18363f9f0510ffa6ff4b.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to battle as one of the galaxy\u2019s elite rangers! With every ranger having a <strong>unique ability</strong>, you get the opportunity to customize and adjust your playstyle and strategy. Gain XP and level up your rangers to <strong>unlock new weapons, stat upgrade points, chromas and more</strong>!</p><p c