e at any skill level, both online and offline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Game</strong> \u2013 No-stakes online either solo or co-op with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked</strong> \u2013 Competitive online with ranks from Silver to Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournaments</strong> \u2013 Monthly online regional competitions with trophy rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaigns\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Singleplayer storylines across the Starhaven galaxy (this feature is in development and not available in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish</strong> \u2013 Offline with bots, with adjustable difficulty and mutators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice</strong> \u2013 Weapons testing and training without limits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/eb626303f08e4f5315b1f09aa027ec6a.poster.avif?t=1752174125\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/eb626303f08e4f5315b1f09aa027ec6a.webm?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574210/extras/eb626303f08e4f5315b1f09aa027ec6a.mp4?t=1752174125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
